# Identifiers belonging to targets this project has been assessed against.
# One per line, matched as fixed strings (not regex). Comments and blanks ignored.
#
# Copy to .publish-scrub (gitignored) and fill in. Add entries as you assess new
# targets, not at publication time.
#
# Include:
#   repository or project names      my-client-app
#   distinctive symbol names         SessionAccumulator
#   file paths that appear in output src/net/their_handler.c
#   hostnames, internal domains      api.internal.example
